notes={
6:('ACCEPT_BOUNDED_SOURCE_VIEW_REMOVAL_CANDIDATE','The actual HH physical26 compulsory content says Polarimetrie (allgemeines Prinzip) in the increased-level protein topic. The existing f4d5a02d goal explicitly addresses optical activity, specific rotation and polarimetry; both whole DE/EN texts correspond. The new partial edge and HH applicability extend that actual goal to the correct source. Molecular polarity is retained separately and is not credited as polarimetry. Other old chromatographic/Rf partner duties remain as independently first-reviewed.','General optical rotation/polarimetry explanation only; no real polarimeter operation or P/native/A/M/V approval.'),
10:('ACCEPT_BOUNDED_SOURCE_MODEL_CONTRACT_AND_VIEW_REMOVAL_CANDIDATE','The actual MV physical20 compulsory metal-current model names the external voltage source, mobile electrons and vibrating metal ions as obstacles. The unchanged fcaf8c9b goal develops a metallic-structure model from properties; its new source-specific operational contract now explicitly includes all three current-model elements and keeps ionic-solution conduction separate. This is an appropriate chemistry model contribution, already present as a target, with a new explicit partial source edge.','Acceptance is bounded to this full operative source model contract. Current P material must actually assess those three elements and distinguish metallic from ionic conduction before native/current strict approval; neither the old target ID nor this written source role certifies learner performance.'),
24:('HOLD_PROPOSED_REMOVAL_BILINGUAL_QUANTITATIVE_OPERATOR_GAP','The actual SN physical49 LK compulsory left column requires experimental conduct AND quantitative evaluation of redox titrations. The new 2fdd759f partial edge repairs the acid/base-only source partner choice. DE explicitly performs/evaluates titrations and determines electron-acceptor/donor concentrations. Unchanged EN says perform and evaluate the principle of redox titrations and omits determining concentrations. This is not a complete bilingual version of the actual quantitative/conduct operation.','Accept the intended redox-specific source partner as a partial candidate; hold the whole new source/view remedy until exact EN conduct/evaluation/concentration fidelity and actual finite P/procedural material are independently checked. Manganometry and water investigation on the right are examples, not a requirement to execute both. No real laboratory performance claim.'),
29:('ACCEPT_BOUNDED_SOURCE_COURSE_CORRECTION_AND_GK_REMOVAL_CANDIDATE','Actual TH physical57 places the pupil TLC separation of amino-acid mixtures with ninhydrin in the right column, additional increased level. General chromatography description and amino-acid Rf evaluation remain in the left compulsory column for both levels. The new extraction changes only this actual pupil-TLC row to LK and preserves every source text and all original partner edges. The other two source clauses of this GK opaque occurrence remain carried by their previously read titration/chromatography partners.','The GK removal cannot waive actual TLC conduct for LK. Its original full clause and mappings remain. No practical execution, whole-course, or native P approval is claimed.'),
30:('ACCEPT_BOUNDED_SOURCE_COURSE_CORRECTION_AND_GK_REMOVAL_CANDIDATE','Actual TH physical58 places Darstellung des PET-Wertstoffkreislaufs only in the additional increased-level right column. The new source goal and normal facet are LK only, with all original content/partner decisions exact. The adjacent general recycling distinctions and ecological/economic evaluation remain compulsory for both levels and are not removed. This resolves the previous coarse GK_LK metadata error for this occurrence.','This accepts corrected course applicability and the bounded GK opaque removal. PET presentation remains an LK obligation, with existing matter-cycle/recycling partners, and whole TH courses/native scopes remain unapproved.'),
19:('HOLD_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_EDGE_ABSENT','RP actual physical42 P4.4 requires one primary, one secondary and one fuel-cell example; its LK additum includes further examples. Existing whole target16b24dc5 includes secondary construction, function, energetics and source critique and is already an original target. Its content is a viable partner, so the earlier description of a general absence of secondary content is narrowed. The actual original source decision and full partner list do not bind it, and the new v2 does not add that source edge.','Retain this opaque occurrence until an actual new partial source edge/contracts to the already-target secondary goal preserves all original primary/fuel-cell and mandatory chosen examples. Do not infer scope closure from target membership.'),
22:('HOLD_ELIMINATION_DUTY_MISSING_CORRECTING_OWN_FIRST_ACCEPT','Actual SN grade9 physical29 explicitly places Kennen von Substitution, Addition und Eliminierung in the compulsory left column. The whole mapped reaction-type cluster9aec52cb and its four atomic descendants have halogen comparison, radical substitution, electrophilic addition, bonding/tests, with no elimination operation. Actual new canonical504 contains no elimination description; none of the new five corrections supplies it. Own earlier first acceptance was too broad and is corrected only in this separate followup.','The compulsory basic elimination operation needs an assessable actual partner/source witness. The optional WB2 cracking study physical30 remains conditional on selection; it is not made universal. Preserve all real experimental/digital source duties and do not claim performance.'),
26:('HOLD_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_EDGE_ABSENT','SN selected secondary-cell application appears on actual physical57 (the preserved sourceSpan says PDF56, an adjacent preceding page). Target16b24dc5 is already present and has viable secondary construction/function/energetics content. The actual original decision/full partner list for the secondary source row omit it, and v2 adds no edge.','Retain occurrence until an actual bound source contribution covers selected secondary-cell application, with the actual physical57 witness stated precisely. Documentation/presentation/digital/project examples in the right column are not turned into new universal tasks; adjacent compulsory physical/digital measurement duties stay retained.'),
31:('HOLD_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_EDGE_ABSENT','TH actual physical53 compulsory both-level left column requires classification into primary/secondary/tertiary cells and construction/function explanation for one example each. Existing target16b24dc5 can carry secondary function/content alongside the other partners, but is absent from the original mapped decision/list and not added by v2.','An actual new partial source edge/operative case for the secondary contribution is still needed; preserve classification and primary/fuel-cell examples. The additional LK lithium-ion detail on the right is not imposed on GK.'),
34:('HOLD_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_EDGE_ABSENT','TH LK shares the physical53 compulsory primary/secondary/tertiary classification and one-example construction/function clause. Existing target16b24dc5 has viable secondary content and is already targeted; actual original mapping omits it and v2 does not repair this edge.','Retain original source and all partners until an explicit new secondary contribution is authored/reviewed. Additional LK lithium-ion detail remains a separate existing increased-level duty; no complete LK or native approval follows from this one source clause.')}
